            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="37819752-fbc6-5464-ad45-17490825eae1">1+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="989bc79d-9e4b-528b-b966-eff3ce994cc7">Heavy 1, 10” Blast, Does Not Hit Self, Monsterbane, Hull, Primary</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="37e7f9c1-8b09-540d-ba64-531be07de55d" name="Transport 104" hidden="false">
          <description>Each foot carriers up to Transport 52 with Access on the Front, Outer Side, and Rear. Each Foot as one Firing Port in the Front, Outer Side, and Rear.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fa322a23-af94-5fc7-96f4-587fd33b4453" name="Create Panic" hidden="false">
          <description>This model displaces all models when it moves, place them up to 1” Away. Immobile units prevent this model from moving there.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="dc5864cf-edfe-54f8-a0c9-0c057e9d0a3a" name="Nuclear Meltdown" hidden="false">
          <description>This model explodes on a 4+ with S Destroyer AP1+ in a 8d6” Radius.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="384b4c20-c9b7-5913-8a10-a60078deb1e7" name="Titanic Tread" hidden="false">
          <description>Any movement made by models that are not Flying or High Altitude cost twice as much within 30” of this model.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="58f1a969-f0c3-5528-b602-097070537ef0" name="Towering God Engine" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may only be hit on a 5+ or worse in Melee.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3d8e7c03-1ba4-5bb5-81f2-ed4626efeb0a" name="Titanic God Engine" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may ignore all Non- Titanic models and Terrain for the purposes of Moving, Advancing, Falling Back, and Charging.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0e4eebce-9367-5ef8-baf1-87bff6dea560" name="Uparmoured" hidden="false">
          <description>Only Ardex Defensor weapons may be disabled on this model.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="d8a1b614-7600-541b-833a-73b429c0abda" name="Earthshock" hidden="false">
          <description>Any unit Hit by this Template only Moves, Advances, Charges, and Falls Back at Half Speed until your next Command Phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0d0fa05d-055b-5d84-a1e3-4f635bc76ff3" name="The Hour is Nigh" hidden="false">
          <description>When the weapon is fired, place a marker on field at a valid target. In your next Command Phase, the missile strikes! Scatter like normal, following the 15” Blast radius rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="5b5b452c-5706-57ef-a588-2666a1262766" name="T Minus 5" hidden="false">
          <description>The weapon may not be fired Turn 1. The weapon cannot be destroyed or Disabled. If the weapon is marked on the field and the carrier is destroyed, the Deathstrike Missile still hits in your Command Phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
