      <rules>
        <rule id="f6336c7a-ea65-5c15-b614-3f79568220d1" name="Create Panic" hidden="false">
          <description>This model displaces all models when it moves, place them up to 1” Away. Immobile units prevent this model from moving there.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4129d626-a0fc-5e5d-8cad-9266aae1f109" name="Nuclear Meltdown" hidden="false">
          <description>This model explodes on a 4+ with S Destroyer AP1+ in a 6d6” Radius.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c5ae8b1f-ea5a-5895-996c-e536234be699" name="Towering God Engine" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may only be hit on a 5+ or worse in Melee.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4acc4dca-ce1a-50c7-931f-6bf1e8dff1b0" name="Titanic God Engine" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may ignore all Non- Titanic models and Terrain for the purposes of Moving, Advancing, Falling Back, and Charging.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c650a58c-ba4a-51d7-b5ad-2a0879f8ff50" name="Uparmoured" hidden="false">
          <description>Only Ardex Defensor weapons may be disabled on this model.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="00b7e8ce-5261-5f2b-a62d-ff40f3aaa346" name="World Ending Hammer" hidden="false">
          <description>Monster or Vehicle units slain by these attacks can be thrown up to 48” away, scattering like a template and causing Auto Hits against each model underneath them at their S# with AP-. Titanic units can be thrown this way, but only up to 24” Instead and inflict S# AP2+. Roll for Explodes after the slain unit comes to a rest and Auto Hits are resolved.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="7a7bac11-62a3-5809-bb64-b3b1f9c75fad" name="Earthshock" hidden="false">
          <description>Any unit Hit by this Template only Moves, Advances, Charges, and Falls Back at Half Speed until your next Command Phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
